  "theoryOfChange": "Dream.Org's 2024 Impact Report outlines their strategic approach to achieving their goals in justice, green jobs, and economic equity. The report details their strategies, such as advocating for climate funds to be allocated to underserved communities and removing barriers for underserved entrepreneurs through their accelerator program. It also sets out long-term goals, including ensuring 40% of climate investments from the Inflation Reduction Act go to disadvantaged communities and increasing climate contracts for minority-owned businesses. The report describes how their integrated policy, advocacy, coalition building, technical assistance, and programming are designed to achieve these outcomes.",
